This product ingests and redistributes data from third-party sources, each
under its own terms. HALI claims no ownership of that data. Attribution as
required by each provider:

  GDACS — Global Disaster Alert and Coordination System, a cooperation
  between the United Nations and the European Commission.

  FEWS NET — Famine Early Warning Systems Network, USAID.

  HDX HAPI — Humanitarian Data Exchange, UN OCHA. Licensed per dataset.

  IFRC GO — International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent
  Societies.

  WHO Disease Outbreak News — World Health Organization.

  ICPAC — IGAD Climate Prediction and Applications Centre. GeoPortal WMS
  layers are served live from ICPAC's own infrastructure.

  CHIRPS — Climate Hazards Center, UC Santa Barbara.

  NOAA GFS — National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration.

  GloFAS — Global Flood Awareness System, Copernicus Emergency Management
  Service. Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information.

  WorldPop — WorldPop, University of Southampton. Licensed CC BY 4.0.

  OCHA COD-AB — Common Operational Datasets, administrative boundaries,
  UN OCHA.

  Natural Earth — public domain, naturalearthdata.com.
